        (message "This Amiga has a graphics card's own Warp3D (LIBS:Warp3D/HWdrivers). OpenUp's Warp3D "
                 "draws on the CPU here and would take its place, so it was left out. Nothing else changed. "
                 "(If those drivers are only Wazp3D's, OpenUpTool INSTALL Parts/Warp3D in a Shell installs it.)")
